Revision history for Scalar::ValueTags::LineageTracking

NOTE: Odd versions are trial versions; even versions are release versions

0.001 2026-07-27
 - First trial version

0.002 2026-07-27
 - First release version
 - bump Scalar::ValueTags to 0.004

0.004 2026-07-31
 - API changes:
  - pluralize to add_data_sources, allowing multiple sources
  - pluralize to set_data_sources, allowing multiple sources
  - clear_data_sources now returns previous sources, replacing get_and_clear_sources
  - re-organize tests
